.TH DANBY-ODESYSTEMS 1
.SH NAME
danby-odesystems \- coupled first-order ODE laboratory
.SH DESCRIPTION
The app contrasts a scalar exponential equation with the two-component harmonic
oscillator x'=v, v'=-x.  Exact and adaptive numerical components are overlaid,
showing that a system is advanced as one state vector with shared step control.
.SH CONTROLS
1 selects the scalar problem, 2 the system, F cycles injected faults, plus and
minus change tolerance, R resets, and Q exits.
